  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\nCurrently, it is not possible to use the `src` attribute on a `<script type=\"importmap\">` element to load an import map from an external JSON file.\n\nIt would be useful to support this attribute, allowing developers to keep their import maps in separate files instead of having to write them directly inside HTML documents.\n\nFor example:\n\n<script type=\"importmap\" src=\"./imports.json\"></script>\n<script type=\"module\" src=\"./main.js\"></script>\n\nThis would make import maps easier to manage, especially in large projects and package management systems.",
